{"root":{"data":{"id":"186962c297db","created":1540381049,"text":"PythonCookbook"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"bpb7irfj50xs","created":1540381080826,"text":"数据结构和算法"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"bpb7j4xkya68","created":1540381110216,"text":"序列的拆包"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"bpb7jaudqccg","created":1540381123083,"text":"可以用_来接收不需要的变量值"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"bpb7kckevv28","created":1540381205198,"text":"可迭代对象的拆包"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"bpb7kh3wgg00","created":1540381215083,"text":"不确定具体个数时，用*variable_name表示接收的值个数不定（0-任意个）"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"bpdm9ifuy0ao","created":1540625792539,"text":"栈和队列"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"bpdm9qes1fk0","created":1540625809888,"text":"collections.deque()可以快速往队列头部插入/删除值，实现先进先出"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"bpdmblnkmb5s","created":1540625956264,"text":"堆数据结构"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"bpdmbuy8rgn4","created":1540625976501,"text":"heapq.nlargest()和heapq.nsmallest()"},"children":[]}]}]}]},"template":"default","theme":"fresh-blue","version":"1.4.43"}